  - Open your timetable to see your lessons for the week.
  - Read the student handbook in the Document Hub.
  - Visit your tutor on the first morning of term.

If any of the details above look wrong, reply to this message or speak to a member of the admissions team.

We're really glad you're joining us — see you on day one!

The Admissions Team
